  - quantum chemistry
abstract: >-
  ORCA PED Analyzer is a molecule-agnostic Python utility for assigning ORCA
  harmonic normal modes through a normalized diagonal potential-energy
  distribution in internal coordinates, with optional VPT2/GVPT2 integration,
  IR-spectrum generation, CSV export, and Avogadro CJSON export.
